      "contentPreview": "CHECKED AND CLEAN \u2014 do not re-raise. (1) ApiKeyStore: 32-byte CSPRNG keys, per-key 16-byte salt, CryptographicOperations.FixedTimeEquals for comparison. Single-round SHA-256 is CORRECT here because these are high-entropy server-generated secrets, not user passwords; swapping in a KDF would be cargo-culting. (2) MemoryTools.Lifecycle.cs:594\u0027s \u0027catch { return false; }\u0027 and the 10240-char read window in the restore() conflict scan are an explicitly best-effort warning path (:600) \u2014 acceptable. (3)",
